sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant React as React Dashboard
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    User->>React: Review signal
    React->>API: POST /api/signals/{id}/accept OR reject
    API->>DB: Load signal
    DB-->>API: Signal + status
    API->>API: Validate signal state + user permission

    alt Accept
        API->>DB: Set status = Accepted
        API->>Audit: Record acceptance
        Audit-->>API: Recorded
        API-->>React: Accepted signal
        React-->>User: Confirmation
    else Reject
        API->>DB: Set status = Rejected
        API->>Audit: Record rejection
        Audit-->>API: Recorded
        API-->>React: Rejected signal
        React-->>User: Confirmation
    end
